{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You shall bear the iniquity of your priesthood.</b> If you do not guard the priesthood, the iniquity is upon you. <b>And you and your sons with you before the tent of the testimony</b> — that is, you shall be before it always. And they expounded in the Sifre: the priests were within and the Levites without — that is, to guard it and to go about it at night roundabout, by way of honor and preeminence."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:33:41.836359072Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}